WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:03.231
What's on your shelf that <b>isn't selling</b>?

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:05.340
Tap <b>Sin movimiento</b> (no movement)

00:00:05.407 --> 00:00:09.119
See how much money is tied up in stock that does not sell

00:00:09.195 --> 00:00:15.068
And the list of those products, to put them on sale or stop ordering them
